<title>USA: Mecklermedia adds three foreign editions.</title>
<headline>Mecklermedia adds three foreign editions.</headline>
<dateline>WESTPORT, Conn. 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mecklermedia Corp said Tuesday that it had signed agreements to produce three additional foreign editions of its Internet World magazine.</p>
<p>The three new editions will appear in the Chinese language in Taiwan, in English in The Philippines and in Turkish in Turkey.</p>
<p>Internet World is already licensed for publication in Argentina, Korea, Brazil, Mexico, the Middle East Germany, and the United Kingdom, Mecklermedia said.</p>
</text>
